  "review": {
    "status": "approved",
    "reviewer": "Claude (AI review at the product owner's direction)",
    "date": "2026-10-05",
    "comment": "A fixed catalogue, not free-text understanding. A reader types and the app suggests from this list; the answer is always derived from the question they chose, never from what they typed, so the reading stays deterministic and reproducible and no birth detail leaves the device. A question with no match is told so rather than answered from a guess. Keywords are match terms only and are never shown as content."
